[l_english.bitumen_infrastructure]
Bitumen Roads

[l_english.bitumen_infrastructure_desc]
Compared to traditional infrastructure in Equestria, bitumen roads have higher traffic efficiency, facilitating rapid deployment of the army and daily industrial construction and resource extraction. However, bitumen roads require oil to build and maintain.

[l_english.bitumen_infrastructure_plural]
Bitumen Roads

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_bitumen_infrastructure_factor]
§YBitumen Roads§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_bitumen_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Bitumen Roads construction.

[l_simp_chinese.bitumen_infrastructure]
沥青公路

[l_simp_chinese.bitumen_infrastructure_desc]
相比于小马利亚传统的基础设施，沥青公路具有更高的通行效率，方便军队的快速部署以及日常的工业建设和资源开采。不过，沥青公路需要消耗石油修建与维护。

[l_simp_chinese.bitumen_infrastructure_plural]
沥青公路

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_bitumen_infrastructure_factor]
§Y沥青公路§!建造速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_bitumen_infrastructure_factor_desc]
改变沥青公路的建造速度。

